* ZDE - FULL-SCREEN TEXT EDITOR

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* ZDE - FULL-SCREEN TEXT EDITOR

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    SYSUTLS:ZDE filespec

Edits plain text with WordStar-style control keys. Example: SYSUTLS:ZDE
I0:NOTE.TXT

Ctrl-K D saves the file and returns to editing/file selection; Ctrl-K X
saves and exits; Ctrl-K Q abandons the current edit after confirmation.
Inspect the on-screen prompts before discarding changes. Use copied text
for practice. Do not send binary or compressed HLP data through an
ordinary text editor.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
